  "description": "Seo Eun-gyu comes to the International Contracts Team after being promoted to the youngest deputy manager in history.    \n\nMoon Da-won, a coworker who always lagged behind him and finished her rookie training in second place, is not thrilled to see him.   \n\nHowever, this man, Seo Eun-gyu, is excessively kind to Da-won.   \n\nAfter drinking, Da-won ends up sleeping with Eun-gyu. And ever since that night, Eun-gyu begs her:\n\n\"Think of me as a toy. A sex toy to use when you're stressed.\"\n\nSlowly, she begins to feel drawn to this perfect man who is willing to give her everything.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/3000017505), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/3000017506)",
